# i-nudge: System Flow & Implementation Details

This document defines the system flows, state machine progressions, budget calculation pipeline, and decision engines for the **i-nudge** application.

---

## 1. End-to-End User Journey & State Transitions

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Onboarding: First-Time User

    state Onboarding {
        EnterName: Enter User Name
        Activate: Click Activate i-nudge
        EnterName --> Activate
    }

    Onboarding --> ProductTour: Account Activated (onboarded = true)

    state ProductTour {
        StepHome: Step 1: Liquidity & Debt Stack
        StepEmergency: Step 2: Emergency Priorities
        StepSimulation: Step 3: Purchase Simulation
        StepCoach: Step 4: Daily Budget Coach
        StepHome --> StepEmergency
        StepEmergency --> StepSimulation
        StepSimulation --> StepCoach
    }

    ProductTour --> Dashboard: Tour Complete / Skipped

    state Dashboard {
        [*] --> HomeTab
        HomeTab --> CoachTab: Tab 2 / Key '2'
        HomeTab --> SimTab: Tab 3 / Key '3'
        HomeTab --> EmergencyTab: Tab 4 / Key '4'
        HomeTab --> ProfileTab: Tab 5 / Key '5'

        CoachTab --> HomeTab: Tab 1 / Key '1'
        SimTab --> HomeTab: Tab 1 / Key '1'
        EmergencyTab --> HomeTab: Tab 1 / Key '1'
        ProfileTab --> HomeTab: Tab 1 / Key '1'
    }

    state SimTab {
        [*] --> ConfigForm
        ConfigForm --> BlockedScreen: Daily Pool < RM 300
        BlockedScreen --> ConfigForm: Adjust Parameters

        ConfigForm --> LoadingScreen: Click Analyse (Enter)
        LoadingScreen --> RiskEvaluation: 3s Animated Evaluation

        state RiskEvaluation {
            [*] --> ImpactCheck
            ImpactCheck --> SafeScreen: Total Impact < 50%
            ImpactCheck --> HighRiskScreen: Total Impact >= 50%
        }

        SafeScreen --> ConfirmBuy: Confirm Purchase
        ConfirmBuy --> HomeTab: BNPL Added to Stack

        HighRiskScreen --> Postpone: Postpone to Next Month
        Postpone --> HomeTab: Purchase Postponed

        HighRiskScreen --> ProceedAnywayFlow: Continue to Buy
        
        state ProceedAnywayFlow {
            ViewHours: View Wage Slavery Hours
            ViewDisaster: View Zero Buffer Warning
            CheckAccountability: Check Accountability Agreement
            CountdownTimer: 7-Second Friction Timer
            ViewHours --> ViewDisaster
            ViewDisaster --> CheckAccountability
            CheckAccountability --> CountdownTimer
        }

        CountdownTimer --> DangerModeTriggered: Countdown Expires
    }

    DangerModeTriggered --> HomeTab: Danger Mode Active (Pulsing Red)
    ProfileTab --> Onboarding: Click Logout Icon
```

